🔐 Security Best Practices

Use read-only Git repos for visibility

Secure access to the web UI with authentication (SSO, OAuth)

Enable RBAC for fine-grained control

Keep secrets encrypted or managed outside Git (e.g., Sealed Secrets, External Secrets)



